# patches/series.phase1: Phase 1 patch entries, for Phase 0 tooling to merge into patches/series.
# Every entry is an INTENT patch (header + described change, no diff hunks) because no Chromium checkout was available.
# Entries are commented out with '#UNVERIFIED' so the apply step does not try to apply them. After making the described
# edits on the pinned tree, run scripts/refresh-patches.sh <name> and remove the '#UNVERIFIED ' prefix.
#UNVERIFIED ui/0210-native-window-shell-hosts-webui-chrome.patch
#UNVERIFIED extensions/0300-allow-mv2-no-deprecation.patch
#UNVERIFIED extensions/0310-webrequest-blocking-for-mv2.patch
#UNVERIFIED extensions/0320-preinstalled-extension-provider.patch
#UNVERIFIED extensions/0330-newtab-override-hook.patch
